{"id":"f343038d47627223","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy.md","title":"可证性、部分真理与全算术真理","display":"prop-expressive-power-hierarchy — 可证性、部分真理与全算术真理","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy","aliases":["91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy","91-prop-expressive-hierarchy"],"display":"prop-expressive-power-hierarchy — 可证性、部分真理与全算术真理","depends_on":["[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy</span><span>91-prop-expressive-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-expressive-power-hierarchy — 可证性、部分真理与全算术真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84940566355062f6\" href=\"?note=84940566355062f6\" title=\"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\\)</span> (算术层级)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\Sigma_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\Sigma_n}\\)</span> (标准模型中的真 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 句编码集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (标准模型中的全部算术真句集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (一元算术公式集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}power\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\in\\Sigma_1\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\exists\\tau_n(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau_n,\\operatorname{True}_{\\Sigma_n}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}power\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\in\\Sigma_1\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\exists\\tau_n(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau_n,\\operatorname{True}_{\\Sigma_n}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准 PA 可证性是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可定义谓词；对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，算术中\n也能定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 句的满足关系。Tarski 定理排除的是用\n一个算术公式定义全部算术真理。</p>\n<p>这里比较的是可定义性。给语言加入原始符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 当然增加可写表达式，\n但它是否正确表达全真理、又增加多少可证算术后果，取决于所加公理。\n表达能力、语义充分性和证明论强度不能用同一个 “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>” 混为一谈。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"84940566355062f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\Sigma_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}power\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\in\\Sigma_1\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\exists\\tau_n(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau_n,\\operatorname{True}_{\\Sigma_n}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false}],"bytes":1769,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["849405663